flowchart TD
Input_Vars["**Input Variables**<br/>Buffer capacities for all DelayBuffer instances<br/>Values discrete {1-10}"]
MOO_Optimizer["**MOO Optimizer**<br/>Initialize population<br/>Main optimization loop"]
Population["**Population**<br/>Set of candidate buffer configurations"]
Constraint_Checker["**Constraint Checker**<br/>Ensure integer caps in {1-10}<br/>Reject invalid individuals"]
Parameter_Applier["**Parameter Applier**<br/>Map an individual to buffer cap values<br/>Set DelayBuffer cap attributes before run"]
Simulation_Runner["**Simulation Runner**<br/>Parallel execute run_simulation function<br/>Manage random seeds warmup and measurement"]
Simulation_Model["**Simulation Model**<br/>Existing run_simulation implementation<br/>Contains Machine and DelayBuffer classes and routing"]
Objective_Evaluator["**Objective Evaluator**<br/>Extract throughput and WIP from result<br/>Objectives throughput maximize and WIP minimize"]
Evolutionary_Operators["**Evolutionary Operators**<br/>Selection crossover mutation<br/>Diversity and Pareto preserving mechanisms"]
Pareto_Archive["**Pareto Front**<br/>Archive of non dominated solutions<br/>Updated each generation"]
Results_Aggregator["**Results Aggregator**<br/>Collect KPI energy and bottleneck per solution<br/>Export Pareto recommendations"]
Stop_Criterion["**Stop Criterion**<br/>Max generations or time or convergence threshold"]
Final_Output["**Final Output**<br/>Pareto set of buffer capacities<br/>Recommended configurations for manager"]

Input_Vars --> MOO_Optimizer
MOO_Optimizer --> Population
Population --> Constraint_Checker
Constraint_Checker --> Parameter_Applier
Parameter_Applier --> Simulation_Runner
Simulation_Runner --> Simulation_Model
Simulation_Model --> Objective_Evaluator
Objective_Evaluator --> MOO_Optimizer
MOO_Optimizer --> Evolutionary_Operators
Evolutionary_Operators --> Population
Objective_Evaluator --> Pareto_Archive
MOO_Optimizer --> Pareto_Archive
Pareto_Archive --> Results_Aggregator
Objective_Evaluator --> Results_Aggregator
MOO_Optimizer --> Stop_Criterion
Stop_Criterion --> Results_Aggregator
Results_Aggregator --> Final_Output